## Enforcement

The AI assistant should:

1. Encourage use of traditional partials over ViewComponent
2. Ensure proper partial naming and organization
3. Validate helper usage for complex logic
4. Check for proper local variable usage
5. Verify directory structure follows Rails conventions
6. Promote reusable, focused partials
7. Avoid ViewComponent-specific patterns 